{"parse": {"title": "TWG-04", "pageid": 28163, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TWG-03\" title=\"TWG-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TWG-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/TWG-05\" title=\"TWG-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TWG</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AD.A9.E5.AD.90.E4.BB.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"孩子们\">孩子们</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 孩子们</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Kids</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>好<span class=\"color-value\"></span>奇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>心<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>象<span class=\"color-value\"></span>力<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>外<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>还<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>少<span class=\"color-value\"></span>许<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>报<span class=\"color-value\"></span>复<span class=\"color-value\"></span>心<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190804</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-wurenjiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"wurenjiedao\"><img alt=\"wurenjiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/600px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/900px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/1200px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等待总是无聊的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她从不浪费时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>早上好，司辰。请问你有看到X先生吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>是的，但我们从威尔森先生的办公室出来后，X先生突然说他要去买咖啡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>但我没有在楼下的咖啡店看到他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>本来我还想请他再浏览一下附加条款，起草一份正式的计划书……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>不，这种文书工作交由助手就好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，如果你有空的话。可以帮忙找一下X先生吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"beilinkejie2122haocheku\"><img alt=\"beilinkejie2122haocheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png/600px-Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png/900px-Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png/1200px-Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>找到X并非难事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只消想想一般人偷懒时会去的地方——开阔、空旷，又人迹罕至。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好了，还差一根铁丝……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>谁想成为这个幸运的铁丝赞助者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子们：</div><div>我，我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X在旅馆对面的空车库里。<br />他的面前摆着一个初具雏形的戈德堡装置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>由弹珠、铁丝、生锈的喇叭、缺了底的水桶等随处可见的生活垃圾组成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旁边还围了一群看热闹的小孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>感谢诸位的热情投资，现在这台“全自动弹珠飞行器”已经组装完成了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>只要把机器调试到想要的角度，再按下这根弹簧……就能欣赏到精妙绝伦的弹珠飞行秀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>谁想第一个来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们争先恐后地举手。<br />其中一个小女孩叫得尤其大声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯哼，女士优先。就让苏菲，我们最大的水桶赞助商来剪彩吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>哈哈！叫你之前用泼水机洒我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲发出大仇将报的笑声。<br />她立刻将机器转向了同伴，志得意满地按下了弹簧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弹珠自弹簧迸发，在没有底的水桶里转了三圈，然后又高高跳起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通过了那个锈迹斑斑的喇叭，精准落在了……原位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子们：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>漂亮～！看来苏菲已经成功了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>实际上，不论你将它拨到哪个角度，弹珠最后都会滑回原位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这就是史诗级的发明——不用复位，无限使用的全自动弹珠飞行器！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X开始给自己鼓掌。<br />回应他的是孩子们压倒性的嘘声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>说好的三十米喷射距离呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>垂直飞行距离的确是有三十米啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>还有精准定向！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>精准落回原位也是精准定向啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>早知道不把水桶给你了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们开始讨价还价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夹杂着“再做一个！”、“把泼水机还回来!”、“我会去你家楼下游行！”的呼喊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>X先生……是在给小朋友们表演节目吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>他看起来似乎乐在其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>维尔汀，十四行诗小姐？！你们什么时候过来的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>不用这么紧张，X先生。司辰只是想来看看你的表演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>对了，他们刚刚说的……泼水机是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小女孩：</div><div>那是上一个机器，是世界上最好玩的东西！<br />苏菲被泼水机弄得哭着叫妈妈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>呸呸，我才没哭！那是水啦，水！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……别这么看我。我庄严发誓，我没有在表演过程中让任何人受到伤害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我可以解释这个，真的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X刚想开口，远处就传来了几声呼喊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小女孩：</div><div>……啊，妈妈叫我回去吃药了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>我爸爸也快来接我了，我们明天还能在这里碰面吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小女孩：</div><div>不知道呢……妈妈说如果威尔森先生不发疯，她就能把我送回医院了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>真讨厌……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>为什么我要生病呢？为什么不能也拨一下我的弹簧，然后就自动复位呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯？你好像很喜欢全自动弹珠飞行器？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲：</div><div>才——没——有——！<br />我回去了，水桶就送给你啦，奇怪的哥哥！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们结着伴远去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这些孩子们是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>他们是患有先天性铜代谢障碍症的儿童。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我可以解释这个——但你们要先等一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X叹了一口气，开始拆卸起那个由孩子们捐献的破铜烂铁搭建而成的机器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>给我五分钟。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TWG-04"}}